    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Emissions per GB by region",
      "description": "energy_intensity x PUE x grid_intensity. The daily swing is real: high-solar grids are dramatically cleaner around local midday, which is what makes time-shifted batch routing pay.",
