    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error rate by region",
      "description": "The fourth scoring objective, alongside cost, latency and carbon. Time-decayed rather than a raw ratio, so a region that stops receiving traffic decays toward its last value instead of freezing — a sample-count decay would hide an outage on a shed backend.",
